      "text_unit_id": "tu_0001",
      "verbatim_text": "An intensive strategy of initiation and rapid up-titration of evidence-based treatment before discharge and during frequent and careful follow-up visits in the first 6 weeks following a HF hospitalization is recommended to reduce the risk of HF rehospitalization or death."
    },
    {
      "entities": [],
      "factual_relations": [],
