      "source_grade_records": [],
      "text_unit_id": "tu_0004",
      "verbatim_text": "b Level of evidence."
    },
    {
      "entities": [],
      "factual_relations": [],
      "locator": {
        "additional_cell_indices": [],
        "cell_index": null,
        "header_path": [
          "Recommendation table footnotes"
        ],
        "row_index": null,
        "source_part_index": 1
      },
      "normative_assertions": [],
      "source_grade_records": [],
      "text_unit_id": "tu_0005",
      "verbatim_text": "c In STRONG-HF, the use of ACE-I/ARB/ARNI, beta-blockers, and MRA was evaluated in patients with HFrEF, HFmrEF, and HFpEF."
    },
    {
      "entities": [],
      "factual_relations": [],
      "locator": {
        "additional_cell_indices": [],
        "cell_index": null,
        "header_path": [
          "Recommendation table footnotes"
        ],
        "row_index": null,
        "source_part_index": 1
      },
      "normative_assertions": [],
      "source_grade_records": [],
      "text_unit_id": "tu_0006",
      "verbatim_text": "d This recommendation is based on the reduction of the primary endpoint used in the STRONG-HF trial. However, it should be noted that there was a significant reduction only in HF hospitalization and no reduction in CV death or all-cause death alone and that these results were obtained in a specific patient population, not already on full doses of evidence-based HF therapies, who were haemodynamically stable, with elevated NT-proBNP concentrations at screening (>2500 pg/mL), and a >10% decrease in concentration between screening and randomization, according to the enrolment criteria."
    },
    {
      "entities": [],
      "factual_relations": [],
      "locator": {
        "additional_cell_indices": [],
        "cell_index": null,
        "header_path": [
          "Recommendation table footnotes"
        ],
        "row_index": null,
        "source_part_index": 1
      },
      "normative_assertions": [],
      "source_grade_records": [],
      "text_unit_id": "tu_0007",
      "verbatim_text": "e Although STRONG-HF was based only on triple therapy with neurohormonal modulators, this recommendation also includes empagliflozin or dapagliflozin based on recent evidence. 6,8,9"
    }
  ]
